@startuml
' Diagram: Azure CQRS & Event Sourcing with Event Hubs, Databricks & Synapse
' Source: Microsoft Azure Architecture Center — Data Architecture Guide
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1120
skinparam defaultFontColor #f8fafc
skinparam classBackgroundColor #1e293b
skinparam classBorderColor #38bdf8
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1e293b
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #0284c7
rectangle "Client Command (HTTP POST)" as Write_Client
rectangle "Command API (FastAPI / Go)" as Command_API
rectangle "Domain Rule Validator" as Command_Validator
rectangle "Azure Event Hubs (Kafka Ingestion Stream)" as Azure_Event_Hubs
rectangle "Cosmos DB (Append-Only Event Store)" as Cosmos_Event_Store
rectangle "Projection Worker (Azure Functions)" as Projector_Function
rectangle "Azure SQL / Redis (Read Projections)" as Read_Optimized_DB
rectangle "Query Read API (GraphQL / REST)" as Query_API
rectangle "Azure Stream Analytics (Complex CEP)" as Azure_Stream_Analytics
rectangle "Azure Databricks (Apache Spark Delta Lake)" as Azure_Databricks
rectangle "Azure Synapse Data Warehouse" as Azure_Synapse_Analytics
rectangle "Power BI Executive Live Dashboard" as Power_BI_Dashboard
rectangle "Avro Schema Registry" as Azure_Schema_Registry
rectangle "Blob Storage Dead Letter Queue" as Dead_Letter_Archive
Write_Client --> Command_API : Submit Mutation
Command_API --> Command_Validator : Validate Invariants
Command_Validator --> Azure_Event_Hubs : Publish Domain Event
Azure_Event_Hubs --> Cosmos_Event_Store : Append to Log
Azure_Event_Hubs --> Projector_Function : Stream Event Batch
Projector_Function --> Read_Optimized_DB : Materialize Read View
Read_Optimized_DB --> Query_API : Fast Key-Value Query
Azure_Event_Hubs --> Azure_Stream_Analytics : Sliding Window Telemetry
Azure_Stream_Analytics --> Azure_Databricks : Parquet Delta Feed
Azure_Databricks --> Azure_Synapse_Analytics : ETL Curated Aggregates
Azure_Synapse_Analytics --> Power_BI_Dashboard : DirectQuery Semantic Model
Command_Validator ..> Azure_Schema_Registry : Validate Schema
Azure_Event_Hubs ..> Dead_Letter_Archive : Poison Pill Events
@enduml
